{"title":"Dire Wolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 20 Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (7.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf?lv=19\" title=\"Pick level 19\"><td><b>19</b></td><td>61</td><td>15</td><td>950</td><td class=\"muted\">183 · 21 · 2,850</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\