ide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/d535eb40d6ac5fcfceaa.webp\" alt=\"Dire Wolf\"></div><h3>Dire Wolf</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>20</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 20)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Wolf</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>66</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>15.5</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,000</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>2.9 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>13 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}